#: upses.php
msgid "The Name you would like to give this UPS.  For APCUPSD and NUT Devices, a corresponding Cacti Device will be created automatically for the UPS using this name.  For SNMP based UPS's, you must create the Cacti Device first."
msgstr "Igama ongathanda ukulinika le UPS. Kwizixhobo ze-APCUPSD kunye ne-NUT, isixhobo se-Cacti esihambelanayo siya kuyilwa ngokuzenzekelayo kule UPS kusetyenziswa eli gama. Kwi-UPS esekelwe kwi-SNMP, kufuneka uyile iSixhobo se-Cacti kuqala."

