msgstr "Igama leSiza"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Site that this UPS exists in."
msgstr "ISiza ekhoyo kuso le UPS."

#: upses.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Akukho nto"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Indawo"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Indawo ebonakalayo yesiXhobo. Eli gama lasimahla linokuba ligumbi, indawo yerack, njl."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Isixhobo se-Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Kwi-UPS esekelwe kwi-SNMP, khetha iSixhobo se-Cacti oza kusisebenzisa ngeziqinisekiso ze-SNMP. Kungenjalo, khetha Akukho nto, kwaye iplagin ye-UPS iya kukuyilela iSixhobo ngokuzenzekelayo."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Yila ngokuzenzekelayo kuVavanyo lokuQala"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Iyasebenza"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Khangela ukuze uqalise ngokukhawuleza ukuqokelela idatha."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Ulwazi lwe-APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Igama lomamkeli eliqhuba i-apcupsd okanye iseva ye-NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Izibuko le-TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Faka iZibuko le-TCP lale UPS. I-apcupsd isebenzisa u-3551 ngokungagqibekanga kwaye i-NUT isebenzisa u-3493 ngokungagqibekanga."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuphelelwa (imizuzwana)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Ixesha elilindwa yi-poller kwi-apcupsd okanye iseva ye-NUT phambi kokuyekela kule UPS, ukusuka ku-1 ukuya ku-120 imizuzwana. Ii-UPS ezisekelwe kwi-SNMP zisebenzisa ixesha lokuphelelwa le-SNMP endaweni yoko."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Iinketho ze-NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Igama le-UPS ye-NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Igama le-UPS kweseva ye-NUT, njengoko kudweliswe ngu-\"upsc -l\" (inxalenye ephambi kuka-@ kwi-ups@host). Iseva enye ye-NUT inokunika inkonzo kwii-UPS ezininzi."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzisi le-NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Ayinyanzeliswanga. I-akhawunti ye-upsd.users yokungena ngayo. Shiya ingenanto ukufikelela okungaziwayo kokufunda kuphela, okuyindlela iiseva ze-NUT ezihlala zibekwa esweni ngayo."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Igama lokugqitha le-NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Igama lokugqitha leGama lomsebenzisi le-NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Sebenzisa i-TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Fihla unxibelelwano nge-STARTTLS phambi kokuba kuthunyelwe naziphi na iziqinisekiso. Isatifikethi seseva ye-NUT kunye negama lomamkeli ziyaqinisekiswa, ngoko isatifikethi kufuneka sithenjwe yi-Cacti poller, okanye ungakhomba kwifayile yayo ye-CA / yesatifikethi ngezantsi."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Ifayile ye-CA / yeSatifikethi"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Ayinyanzeliswanga. Umendo opheleleyo kwi-Cacti poller oya kwifayile ye-PEM ephethe isatifikethi se-CA (okanye isatifikethi seseva esizisayinelweyo) ukuze kuqinisekiswe iseva ye-NUT ngokuchasene nayo, umzekelo /etc/nut/upsd.pem. Igama lomamkeli elingentla kufuneka lihambelane nesatifikethi."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Vumela iSatifikethi esiZisayinelweyo"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Yamkela nasiphi na isatifikethi ngaphandle kokusihlola. Unxibelelwano lusafihliwe, kodwa iseva ye-NUT ayiqinisekiswanga, ngoko umntu ophakathi angafunda iziqinisekiso ze-NUT. Khetha iFayile ye-CA / yeSatifikethi engentla."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Iinketho ze-SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Igama lomamkeli apho iarhente ye-snmp ikhoyo."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "I-Poller ID ayinakutshintshwa ngelixa i-UPS iqhagamshelwe kwiSixhobo se-Cacti. Tshintsha i-poller kwisixhobo endaweni yoko."

#: upses.php
